{"nodes": [{"id": "plugin_commands_console_setup_command", "label": "/console-setup Command", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "plugin/commands/console-setup.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Once-per-machine setup for the two keys the plugin manifest cannot carry: the env pair and subagentStatusLine. It merges and never overwrites, checks the machine first (claude pinned at 2.1.231 internals, node 22+, plugin installed), shows the exact keys and waits for an explicit yes - never on a teammate's say-so - backs settings.json up, validates it parses afterwards, and reverses itself on request. It never writes hooks (a copy in settings.json would post every event twice) and never touches statusLine unasked. settings.json over a shell profile because it is per-machine and reaches editor-launched sessions."}], "edges": [{"source": "plugin_commands_console_setup_command", "target": "readme_env_vars", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "plugin/commands/console-setup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plugin_commands_console_setup_command", "target": "readme_subagent_status_line", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "plugin/commands/console-setup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plugin_commands_console_setup_command", "target": "readme_observation_hooks", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "plugin/commands/console-setup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "plugin_commands_console_setup_command", "target": "readme_status_line_policy", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "plugin/commands/console-setup.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "console_machine_setup", "label": "Console Machine Setup Flow", "nodes": ["plugin_commands_console_setup_command", "readme_env_vars", "readme_subagent_status_line", "readme_status_line_policy"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "plugin/commands/console-setup.md"}]}